==Battleground==
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**10 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Pairing [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] or any other [[Wave Shield]]s with an [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] Cat like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] makes this stage trivial. With the Capy and Kories covered, the only real threat is the Brollow spam. However, the aforementioned Octopus Cat's resistance to Floating allows them to hold the line against the Brollows.

A good idea would be to use a red crowd-controller like [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] to freeze the Capy at the beginning, then continually spawn your Wave Shield so that your attackers don't die from the Kories' waves.

